      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA WILD (1) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only one length from the winner Lillyvale Lad in second(25.40) at Grafton. Top prospect. TURBO MOUSE (2) started big odds last time but hit the ground running with a slick early split, giving a sight but fading out of it to finish fourth (30.09) at Wentworth Park over 520m. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. RED REIGN (8) is a promising type who notched his 8th career success when too good (22.90) at this track last time. Is yet to taste defeat at this course. The form out of last race has been strong. Hard to fault the current string of winning form and can continue his winning ways. KALANI SKY (3) is right in the mix.",
